因为我想去纽约的洛克菲勒中心30号实习。

756
00:33:56.620 --> 00:34:01.220
And back in the day before like big internet message boards and things like that,
在那个还没有大型互联网论坛之类的东西的年代，

757
00:34:01.340 --> 00:34:04.700
because I'm 100, you would have a phone number you would call.
因为我都一百岁了，你得打一个电话号码。

758
00:34:04.700 --> 00:34:08.920
And it would, I would say, hi, it'd be like a 30 Rockefeller Center.
然后电话接通了，我说，你好，对方会说是洛克菲勒中心30号。

759
00:34:09.160 --> 00:34:11.700
And I'm like, hi, I would love to apply for an internship.
我说，你好，我想申请实习。

760
00:34:11.940 --> 00:34:13.060
Hold one moment, please.
请稍等。

761
00:34:14.160 --> 00:34:15.200
Transfer you to a machine.
把你转接到录音机。

762
00:34:15.360 --> 00:34:18.260
If you would like to apply for an internship at 30 Rockefeller Center,
如果您想申请洛克菲勒中心30号的实习机会，

763
00:34:18.460 --> 00:34:20.900
