请留下您的姓名和电话号码，会有人给您回电。

764
00:34:20.900 --> 00:34:23.540
I got that message every day for three months.
我连续三个月每天都听到这条留言。

765
00:34:24.200 --> 00:34:30.400
And so one day I called up, I got the woman, NBC, you know, what, 30 Rockefeller Center.
所以有一天我打过去，接通了一位女士，NBC，你知道的，洛克菲勒中心30号。

766
00:34:30.600 --> 00:34:34.620
I said, yes, I was just speaking to a woman about my internship and we got disconnected.
我说，是的，我刚才在和一位女士谈实习的事，结果断线了。

767
00:34:35.480 --> 00:34:37.480
She said, oh, Barbara?
她说，噢，是芭芭拉吗？

768
00:34:37.680 --> 00:34:39.320
I said, yes, Barbara.
我说，是的，芭芭拉。

769
00:34:39.780 --> 00:34:41.120
She said, let me transfer you.
她说，我帮你转接过去。

770
00:34:41.260 --> 00:34:41.960
I said, thank you.
我说，谢谢。

771
00:34:42.860 --> 00:34:43.780
Got to Barbara.
接通了芭芭拉。

772
00:34:44.380 --> 00:34:46.100
Barbara's like, hi, Barbara.
芭芭拉说，你好，我是芭芭拉。

773
00:34:46.100 --> 00:34:49.960
I was like, Barbara, I was just talking to someone about my internship and got disconnected.
我说，芭芭拉，我刚才在和人谈实习的事，结果断线了。

774
00:34:50.440 --> 00:34:53.500
And she was like, oh, were you talking to Nancy?
她说，噢，你刚才是在和南希谈吗？

775
00:34:53.800 --> 00:34:56.360
I was like, yes, I was talking to Nancy.
我说，是的，我是在和南希谈。

776
00:34:56.980 --> 00:34:58.300
Transfer me through to Nancy.
把我转接给南希。

777
00:34:59.120 --> 00:35:00.120
Nancy answers, hello.
南希接了电话，喂。

778
00:35:00.340 --> 00:35:02.980
I'm like, hi, I was talking to someone about my internship.
我说，你好，我刚才在和人谈实习的事。

779
00:35:03.020 --> 00:35:04.860
And she goes, how did you get my number?
她说，你是怎么拿到我的号码的？

780
00:35:06.260 --> 00:35:07.300
Did you tell her?
你告诉她了吗？

781
00:35:07.500 --> 00:35:08.340
I told her.
我告诉她了。

782
00:35:08.500 --> 00:35:12.720
I said, well, for three months I called and I got your voicemail and no one called me back.
我说，我打了三个月电话，一直听到你的语音信箱，也没人给我回电。

783
00:35:12.720 --> 00:35:18.880
So today I called and I lied and I said that I was talking to someone and that person transferred
所以今天我打过去撒了个谎，说我刚才在和人通话，那个人把我转接

784
00:35:18.880 --> 00:35:19.460
me to Barbara.
给了芭芭拉。

785
00:35:19.740 --> 00:35:23.160
And then I told Barbara a version of that lie and she transferred me to you.
然后我又对芭芭拉说了个类似的谎，她就把我转接给你了。

786
00:35:23.820 --> 00:35:25.800
And did Nancy say you're hired?
那南希说你被录用了吗？

787
00:35:26.300 --> 00:35:28.120
Nancy said, can you be here Monday?
南希说，你周一能过来吗？

788
00:35:28.900 --> 00:35:30.260
And I was in Texas.
当时我在德克萨斯州。

789
00:35:30.260 --> 00:35:31.400
It was a Friday.
那天是周五。

790
00:35:31.800 --> 00:35:36.440
I was in Archer City, Texas, very rural area, three hours from a big airport.
我在德克萨斯州的阿彻城，一个非常偏远的地方，离大机场有三个小时路程。

791
00:35:36.680 --> 00:35:37.900
I said, sure thing.
我说，没问题。

792
00:35:38.120 --> 00:35:38.860
What time?
几点？

793
00:35:39.580 --> 00:35:41.280
She said, I'll see you Monday at nine.
她说，周一九点见。

794
00:35:41.500 --> 00:35:42.100
I said, great.
我说，太好了。

795
00:35:42.100 --> 00:35:42.900
I got off the phone.
我挂了电话。

796
