这至今仍是她经历过的最棒的事情之一。

955
00:42:22.680 --> 00:42:28.460
And after she filmed it, she went home and watched every single Office episode from season
拍完之后，她回家把《办公室》从第一季开始，

956
00:42:28.460 --> 00:42:28.700
one.
每一集都看了一遍。

957
00:42:28.860 --> 00:42:29.940
She totally binged it.
她完全沉迷其中了。

958
00:42:30.020 --> 00:42:33.880
And so she was super excited by the time her episode finally aired.
所以当她那一集终于播出时，她超级兴奋。

959
00:42:34.440 --> 00:42:35.960
She was like a super fan.
她简直成了超级粉丝。

960
00:42:36.380 --> 00:42:37.800
That is so fun.
那太有趣了。

961
00:42:37.800 --> 00:42:43.800
But she said to this day, people still write her about being on the show, and she's so proud
但她说直到今天，人们还会写信给她提到她上节目的事，她很自豪

962
00:42:43.800 --> 00:42:45.060
to say that she was part of the Office.
能说自己曾是《办公室》的一员。

963
00:42:45.600 --> 00:42:51.160
Well, listen, guys, Shira was so lovely to tell us about her time in the Office.
好了，各位，希拉能告诉我们她在《办公室》的时光真是太好了。

964
00:42:51.560 --> 00:42:54.780
She has a new film coming out called Half Brothers.
她有一部新电影要上映了，叫《半个兄弟》。

965
00:42:54.780 --> 00:42:59.520
She's also going to be in a pilot on Amazon called On the Spectrum.
她还要出演亚马逊的一部试播集，叫《谱系之上》。

966
00:43:00.020 --> 00:43:03.660
Her Instagram is at Shira Scott Astroff.
她的Instagram账号是Shira Scott Astroff。

967
00:43:04.320 --> 00:43:06.840
But here's the plug I can't wait to give.
但接下来这个宣传是我迫不及待想做的。

