她是动物救援组织“动物救援使命”的创始人。

970
00:43:14.060 --> 00:43:19.560
They rescue abused and neglected dogs and cats in Los Angeles and all over the world.
他们救援洛杉矶乃至全世界被虐待和忽视的猫狗。

971
00:43:19.840 --> 00:43:25.680
She just rescued like 70 dogs from death row in Tijuana.
她刚从蒂华纳的死囚牢里救出了大约70只狗。

972
00:43:25.940 --> 00:43:26.960
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

973
00:43:27.240 --> 00:43:28.560
And placed them in homes.
并为它们找到了家。

974
00:43:28.960 --> 00:43:36.100
So she said if anyone wants to adopt an animal or donate, you can go to the Animal Rescue Mission
所以她说如果有人想领养动物或捐款，可以去“动物救援使命”

975
00:43:36.100 --> 00:43:37.600
and check them out.
看看他们。

976
00:43:37.620 --> 00:43:38.960
I love that.
我喜欢这个。

977
00:43:39.040 --> 00:43:40.980
We have four rescues.
我们养了四只救援动物。

978
00:43:41.180 --> 00:43:42.800
I love little rescue animals.
我爱这些小救援动物。

979
00:43:42.800 --> 00:43:44.360
That makes me so happy.
这让我感到非常快乐。

980
00:43:44.880 --> 00:43:45.560
I know.
我知道。

981
00:43:45.900 --> 00:43:51.020
Should we talk about Dwight preparing for the big press conference back at the office?
我们要聊聊德怀特在办公室为大型新闻发布会做准备的事吗？

982
00:43:51.380 --> 00:43:52.100
Oh, yeah.
哦，好的。

983
00:43:52.340 --> 00:43:55.020
Well, you know, he equates this to beat sales.
嗯，你知道，他把这比作甜菜销售。

984
