You got to put the money beats.
你得把钱甜菜放好。

985
00:43:57.080 --> 00:43:58.520
Those are the attractive beats.
那些是好看的甜菜。

986
00:43:58.620 --> 00:43:59.380
You got to put them up front.
你得把它们摆在前面。

987
00:43:59.380 --> 00:44:00.300
That's right.
没错。

988
00:44:00.600 --> 00:44:08.940
He has set up the conference room for a giant press conference, all for one man.
他把会议室布置成了一个巨大的新闻发布会现场，全是为了一个人。

989
00:44:08.940 --> 00:44:09.980
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

990
00:44:10.340 --> 00:44:13.480
This is Chad Light from the Scranton Times.
这是来自《斯克兰顿时报》的查德·莱特。

991
00:44:13.760 --> 00:44:15.640
He does the lighter side of life.
他负责报道生活轻松的一面。

992
00:44:15.980 --> 00:44:16.360
Yeah.
是啊。

993
00:44:16.720 --> 00:44:17.740
And the obits.
还有讣告。

994
00:44:18.140 --> 00:44:18.500
Right.
对。

995
00:44:18.740 --> 00:44:23.260
And there's a great deleted scene with him and Creed where he recognizes Creed.
有一个很棒的删减片段，他和克里德在一起，他认出了克里德。

996
00:44:23.540 --> 00:44:25.960
He's like, wait, Creed Bratton from the grassroots.
他说，等等，是草根乐队的克里德·布拉顿吗？

997
00:44:26.560 --> 00:44:29.900
Jenna, he basically calls Creed out as himself.
珍娜，他基本上是当面揭穿了克里德的真实身份。

998
00:44:30.300 --> 00:44:30.900
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

999
00:44:30.980 --> 00:44:32.080
And it got deleted again.
结果又被删掉了。

1000
00:44:32.720 --> 00:44:35.460
The origin of Creed keeps getting deleted.
克里德的身世之谜总是被删掉。

1001
00:44:35.660 --> 00:44:37.000
It got deleted out of Booze Cruise.
那段戏在《酒水巡游》里被删掉了。

1002
00:44:37.240 --> 00:44:43.400
It got deleted out of what was the other episode where we found out that he stole his name from someone in prison, the convict.
还有另一集也删掉了，就是我们发现他从监狱里的囚犯那儿偷了名字的那集。

1003
00:44:43.600 --> 00:44:44.660
And now again.
现在又来了一次。

1004
00:44:44.660 --> 00:44:48.560
So, Chad Light goes, Creed Bratton from the grassroots?
所以，查德·莱特就问，你是那个草根出身的克里德·布拉顿吗？

1005
00:44:49.000 --> 00:44:50.060
And Creed's like, yeah.
克里德就说，没错。

1006
00:44:50.440 --> 00:44:52.900
And he goes, I wrote your obituary.
然后他说，我写了你的讣告。

1007
00:44:53.140 --> 00:44:54.740
And Creed was like, oh, yeah.
克里德就说，哦，是吗。

1008
00:44:55.520 --> 00:45:00.620
Creed has this great talking head that he faked his death so he could get like an insurance claim or something.
克里德有个很棒的单人访谈，说他伪造了自己的死亡，这样就能骗取保险金之类的。

1009
00:45:00.780 --> 00:45:01.380
He gets money.
他能拿到钱。

1010
00:45:01.820 --> 00:45:03.360
And so, yeah.
所以，没错。

1011
00:45:03.860 --> 00:45:04.340
Amazing.
太神了。

1012
00:45:04.960 --> 00:45:05.320
Amazing.
太神了。

1013
00:45:05.880 --> 00:45:07.940
Well, Chad Light was played by Anthony Russell.
查德·莱特是由安东尼·拉塞尔饰演的。

1014
00:45:07.940 --> 00:45:14.500
And I found this in Anthony's bio, which I thought was absolutely so charming.
我在安东尼的个人简介里发现了这个，我觉得特别迷人。

1015
00:45:14.780 --> 00:45:20.200
It said, as a child, he played harmonica, ukulele, guitar, trombone, and piano.
上面写着，他小时候会吹口琴、弹尤克里里、吉他、吹长号和弹钢琴。

1016
00:45:20.820 --> 00:45:24.260
He worked his way through college singing in a show band.
他靠在演出乐队唱歌赚取大学学费。

1017
00:45:25.780 --> 00:45:32.220
And after he graduated Montclair State College with a major in trombone and a minor in piano,
在他从蒙特克莱尔州立大学毕业，主修长号、辅修钢琴之后，

1018
00:45:32.580 --> 00:45:37.480
his band was booked as a Las Vegas lounge act for many major hotels.
他的乐队被预订为许多大型酒店的拉斯维加斯酒廊表演嘉宾。

1019
00:45:37.940 --> 00:45:40.620
Well, I played the trombone.
其实，我以前也吹过长号。

1020
00:45:41.620 --> 00:45:42.140
What?
什么？

1021
00:45:44.240 --> 00:45:45.280
No, you did not.
不，你才没有。

1022
00:45:45.640 --> 00:45:46.080
Oh, yeah.
哦，真的。

1023
00:45:47.040 --> 00:45:47.560
Stop it.
别开玩笑了。

1024
00:45:47.600 --> 00:45:48.780
What are you talking about?
你在说什么呢？

1025
00:45:49.040 --> 00:45:49.200
Yeah.
真的。

1026
00:45:49.360 --> 00:45:52.880
When we moved to Archer City, it's a very small town.
我们搬到阿彻城的时候，那是个非常小的镇子。

1027
00:45:53.100 --> 00:45:56.940
Like in football, it was class 2A, super small town.
就像橄榄球比赛，那是2A级别的，超级小的镇子。

1028
00:45:57.120 --> 00:46:00.300
So to have a marching band, pretty much everyone had to participate.
所以为了凑齐行进乐队，几乎每个人都得参加。

1029
00:46:00.820 --> 00:46:05.500
And so all my friends in the town was, you know, I graduated with like 34 people.
镇上我所有的朋友都在，你知道，我毕业时全班才34个人。

1030
00:46:06.700 --> 00:46:09.000
So my friend Shannon was like, are you going to play in the band?
所以我朋友香农就问，你要参加乐队吗？

1031
00:46:09.160 --> 00:46:10.500
And I was like, I don't know how to play an instrument.
我说，我根本不会任何乐器。

1032
00:46:10.660 --> 00:46:11.680
She goes, it doesn't really matter.
她说，那没关系。

1033
00:46:11.900 --> 00:46:13.140
We just need people.
我们只是需要人手。

1034
00:46:14.060 --> 00:46:15.740
And so I was like, well, what do you play?
我就问，那你吹什么？

1035
00:46:15.900 --> 00:46:17.940
Now, my best friend was six foot three, guys.
我最好的朋友身高六英尺三英寸，伙计们。

1036
00:46:18.280 --> 00:46:19.900
She was like star basketball player.
她是明星篮球运动员。

1037
00:46:20.420 --> 00:46:21.340
I said, what do you play?
我说，你吹什么？

1038
00:46:21.440 --> 00:46:22.480
She said, I play trombone.
她说，我吹长号。

1039
00:46:22.600 --> 00:46:23.860
I was like 4'10".
我当时只有4英尺10英寸高。

1040
00:46:23.860 --> 00:46:25.280
I was like, yeah, OK, sounds good.
我说，好吧，听起来不错。

1041
00:46:25.440 --> 00:46:27.780
I'll do what you're doing because I wanted to be able to sit next to her.
你吹什么我就吹什么，因为我想坐在她旁边。

1042
00:46:28.260 --> 00:46:33.820
There was only three people in the trombone section, Shannon, Bill Crutcher, and me.
长号组当时只有三个人，香农、比尔·克鲁彻和我。

1043
00:46:35.180 --> 00:46:40.500
And I said, the first day I sat next to Bill and I said, Bill, what are you playing?
第一天我坐在比尔旁边，我说，比尔，你在吹什么？

1044
00:46:40.680 --> 00:46:44.300
Because all I could hear was like, and he goes, I just play letter F the whole time.
因为我只能听到那种声音，他说，我全程只吹F音。

1045
00:46:44.960 --> 00:46:45.740
I said, OK.
我说，好吧。

1046
00:46:46.480 --> 00:46:48.700
So Shannon was the only one that could really play.
所以只有香农是真正会吹的。

1047
00:46:49.160 --> 00:46:51.020
But I did learn how to play tequila.
但我确实学会了怎么吹《龙舌兰》。

1048
00:46:52.020 --> 00:46:52.720
What's that?
那是什么？

1049
00:46:56.420 --> 00:46:58.160
Yeah, I learned how to play that.
对，我学会了吹那首曲子。

1050
00:46:58.300 --> 00:47:01.420
It's really fun on the trombone because you do this big slide.
用长号吹特别好玩，因为你可以做一个很大的滑音。

1051
00:47:02.160 --> 00:47:09.500
And then I could never reach the last position, seventh position, because I was too short.
然后我就再也够不到最后一个位置，也就是第七个位置，因为我个子太矮了。

1052
00:47:09.600 --> 00:47:10.580
My arms didn't extend.
我的胳膊伸不到那么长。

1053
00:47:13.440 --> 00:47:16.620
Jenna, you wouldn't use a calculator for the year?
珍娜，你不会连年份都要用计算器算吧？

1054
00:47:17.240 --> 00:47:21.960
I was in a band playing a trombone for a few months of my life.
我人生中有几个月参加过乐队，吹长号。

1055
00:47:21.960 --> 00:47:23.480
Very poorly, by the way.
顺便说一下，吹得非常烂。

1056
00:47:23.480 --> 00:47:25.100
Very poorly playing the trombone.
长号吹得非常烂。

1057
00:47:25.340 --> 00:47:26.200
I'm speechless.
我无语了。

1058
00:47:26.680 --> 00:47:27.220
I don't know.
我不知道。

1059
00:47:28.380 --> 00:47:29.380
Where are we?
我们这是在哪儿？

1060
00:47:29.800 --> 00:47:30.540
Oh, God.
天哪。

1061
00:47:30.540 --> 00:47:33.400
I don't know if anyone even is listening anymore.
我不知道还有没有人在这儿听着。

1062
00:47:33.620 --> 00:47:35.340
Well, listen, I'll tell you where we are.
好吧，听着，我来告诉你我们在哪儿。

1063
00:47:35.520 --> 00:47:38.000
Chad Light has gotten level three security clearance.
查德·莱特获得了三级安全许可。

1064
00:47:38.280 --> 00:47:38.980
Don't get excited.
别太激动。

1065
00:47:39.280 --> 00:47:40.400
It's level three out of 20.
总共20级，这只是三级。

1066
00:47:41.380 --> 00:47:44.380
And they're getting ready for this big press conference.
他们正准备召开那场大型新闻发布会。

1067
00:47:45.060 --> 00:47:49.400
Meanwhile, Kevin, Oscar, and Angela are busy apologizing to customers.
与此同时，凯文、奥斯卡和安吉拉正忙着向客户道歉。

1068
00:47:49.420 --> 00:47:50.940
And it is not going well.
而且进展很不顺利。

1069
00:47:50.940 --> 00:47:54.680
Well, because Angela refuses to say the words, I'm sorry.
因为安吉拉拒绝说“我很抱歉”这几个字。

1070
00:47:54.920 --> 00:47:56.220
She will not apologize.
她就是不肯道歉。

1071
00:47:56.240 --> 00:48:00.720
She keeps saying things like, our official position is one of apology.
她总是说些类似“我们的官方立场是表示歉意”之类的话。

1072
00:48:01.040 --> 00:48:04.420
Like, she's like, we'll not just say we are so sorry.
就像是，她不想直接说我们非常抱歉。

1073
00:48:04.860 --> 00:48:10.220
I love it when, like, Kelly is just patiently trying to coach her to say, like, just to make
我喜欢凯莉耐心地教她怎么说，就像是，为了让对话能进行下去。

1074
00:48:10.220 --> 00:48:11.020
conversation.
对话。

1075
00:48:11.580 --> 00:48:13.640
And she's like, where are you from, Ohio?
然后她会说，你是哪里人，俄亥俄州？

1076
00:48:13.800 --> 00:48:14.640
That's nice.
那挺好的。

1077
00:48:15.260 --> 00:48:18.920
She just does not want to be talking to these people.
她就是不想和这些人说话。

1078
00:48:18.920 --> 00:48:20.300
No, no.
不，不。

1079
00:48:20.560 --> 00:48:27.920
And also, by the way, in the meantime, Creed has found out that Debbie Brown did not show
另外，顺便说一下，与此同时，克里德发现黛比·布朗上周没来上班。

1080
00:48:27.920 --> 00:48:29.060
up to work last week.
于是他给德怀特编了一整套故事。

1081
00:48:29.380 --> 00:48:32.160
And he spins a whole tale for Dwight.
他说，好吧，她告诉我说她有紧急的牙医预约。

1082
00:48:32.320 --> 00:48:38.180
He says, well, now she told me that she had an emergency dentist appointment.
德怀特对着镜头看了一眼，我觉得这有点呼应他之前对迈克尔撒谎说自己有牙医预约的情节。

1083
00:48:38.500 --> 00:48:45.440
And Dwight gives a look to camera, which I think is a little bit of a callback to his
还记得吗？

1084
00:48:45.440 --> 00:48:47.780
lie to Michael about his dentist appointment.
记得。

1085
00:48:47.780 --> 00:48:48.780
Remember?
牙医。

1086
00:48:48.780 --> 00:48:49.280
Yes.
没错。

1087
00:48:49.640 --> 00:48:49.940
The dentiSt.
但后来他说，黛比又告诉她公司的人说她得了肠胃感冒。

1088
00:48:50.660 --> 00:48:51.180
Yes.
所以她显然是在编造借口，以逃避对水印事件的责任。

1089
00:48:51.520 --> 00:48:56.240
But then he says, well, then Debbie told the people at her work that she had the stomach
他真是演得太夸张了。

1090
00:48:56.240 --> 00:48:56.520
flu.
克里德真是心狠手辣。

1091
00:48:56.700 --> 00:49:01.560
So she's clearly just making things up to avoid taking responsibility for this watermark.
是啊。

1092
00:49:02.220 --> 00:49:03.840
He's really laying it on thick.
好吧，艾伦小姐到了。

1093
00:49:04.820 --> 00:49:05.920
Creed is vicious.
在我们进入那场非常尴尬的新闻发布会之前，我们先休息一下好吗？

1094
00:49:06.400 --> 00:49:06.620
Yeah.
好，在进入那个环节之前我们需要喘口气。

1095
00:49:07.080 --> 00:49:09.340
Well, Miss Allen arrives.
我们保证接下来的节目里只聊《办公室》。

1096
00:49:09.480 --> 00:49:13.580
And before we get into this really embarrassing press conference, why don't we take a break?
我们明明知道那不是真的，你为什么要保证这个？

1097
00:49:13.580 --> 00:49:16.820
Yeah, we need a moment before we get to this.
噢。

1098
00:49:17.080 --> 00:49:20.920
We promise we're going to just talk about the office for the rest of the show.
噢。

1099
00:49:21.040 --> 00:49:23.360
Why would you promise that when we know it's not true?
噢。

1100
00:49:23.840 --> 00:49:24.320
Oh.
噢。

1101
00:49:24.600 --> 00:49:25.160
We'll try.
我们会试试的。

1102
00:49:25.360 --> 00:49:25.740
We'll try.
我们会试试的。

1103
00:49:26.180 --> 00:49:26.240
We'll try.
我们会试试的。

1104
00:49:27.120 --> 00:49:35.830
All right.
好吧。

1105
00:49:36.070 --> 00:49:36.950
So we are back.
所以我们回来了。

1106
00:49:37.150 --> 00:49:38.470
We are laser focused.
我们现在高度专注。

1107
